    "text": {
     "en": "Look at things around us, like a water pot, a gullak, a birdbath and a kulhad.\nHave you wondered what they are made of? Who made them and how?\nMany are made from clay by potters.\nThings are made step by step: get the material, shape it, dry it and finish it.\nPeople with special skills make them, like potters, carpenters and weavers."
    }
